# The stage0 compiler's row reader: the lexer's tokens grouped into words and
# the words into rows, `<subject> <predicate> <payload>`, one row per line.
#
# A word is a name (an identifier, or identifiers joined by `.` with no space
# around the dots: `console.writeLine` is one word), an integer (digits, with a
# `-` written directly before them for a negative number), or quoted text. Each
# word keeps where it starts and how many bytes of source it covers; its text
# is read from the source when it is needed, so nothing is copied while rows
# are built. A row is a run of words in the word list.
#
# Every reason stage0 refuses a source is a variant of `Rejection`, carrying the
# word the diagnostic points at; the later passes (model, subset, emitc) raise
# the same type.

syntax is module
syntax purpose "Group a source's tokens into rows of words, and read a word's text back from the source"
syntax path syntax
syntax imports standard.string
syntax imports standard.buffer
syntax imports standard.list
syntax imports standard.math
syntax imports standard.compare
syntax imports standard.logic
syntax imports standard.byte
syntax imports standard.test
syntax imports lexer
syntax exports WordKind
syntax exports Word
syntax exports Words
syntax exports Row
syntax exports Rows
syntax exports Rejection
syntax exports groupRows
syntax exports wordText
syntax exports isText
syntax exports sameText
syntax exports putWord
syntax exports diagnostic
syntax exports listRows

WordKind is enum
WordKind purpose "What a word is: a name, an integer with its value, or quoted text"
WordKind typeParameter none
WordKind variant name none
WordKind variant integer Int64
WordKind variant text none

Word is record
Word purpose "One word of a row: its kind, where its first character is, and how many bytes it covers"
Word typeParameter none
Word field kind WordKind
Word field start string.Position
Word field length Int64

Words is typeInstance
Words purpose "Every word of a source, in source order"
Words in none
Words instantiates list.List Word

Row is record
Row purpose "One row: the position of its first word in the word list, and how many words it has"
Row typeParameter none
Row field first Int64
Row field count Int64

Rows is typeInstance
Rows purpose "Every row of a source, in source order"
Rows in none
Rows instantiates list.List Row

Rejection is enum
Rejection purpose "Why stage0 refuses a source, with the word the diagnostic points at"
Rejection typeParameter none
Rejection variant strayMark Word
Rejection variant gluedWords Word
Rejection variant danglingDot Word
Rejection variant shortRow Word
Rejection variant outsideSource Word
Rejection variant unsupportedKind Word
Rejection variant strayRow Word
Rejection variant duplicateName Word
Rejection variant badMain Word
Rejection variant noMain Word
Rejection variant unsupportedPredicate Word
Rejection variant unsupportedPayload Word
Rejection variant unsupportedType Word
Rejection variant badLiteral Word
Rejection variant unsupportedEscape Word
Rejection variant unknownValue Word
Rejection variant wrongType Word
Rejection variant unsupportedTarget Word
Rejection variant wrongArgument Word
Rejection variant argumentCount Word
Rejection variant unknownLabel Word
Rejection variant unknownCall Word
Rejection variant unsupportedStep Word
Rejection variant notMutable Word
Rejection variant splitBlock Word
Rejection variant unsupportedLoop Word
Rejection variant notFailing Word
Rejection variant lostName Word
Rejection variant typeOrder Word
Rejection variant unknownVariant Word
Rejection variant unknownOwner Word
Rejection variant invalidCharacter Word
Rejection variant unterminatedText Word
Rejection variant integerTooLarge Word

