groupRows label punctuationCase within visit
groupRows label dotCase loopKind none
groupRows label dotCase within visit
groupRows label dotJoin loopKind none
groupRows label dotJoin within visit
groupRows label minusTest loopKind none
groupRows label minusTest within visit
groupRows label minusCase loopKind none
groupRows label minusCase within visit
