rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unsupportedPredicate bind unsupportedPredicateWord Word goto unsupportedPredicateCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unsupportedPayload bind unsupportedPayloadWord Word goto unsupportedPayloadCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unsupportedType bind unsupportedTypeWord Word goto unsupportedTypeCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.badLiteral bind badLiteralWord Word goto badLiteralCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unsupportedEscape bind unsupportedEscapeWord Word goto unsupportedEscapeCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unknownValue bind unknownValueWord Word goto unknownValueCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.wrongType bind wrongTypeWord Word goto wrongTypeCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unsupportedTarget bind unsupportedTargetWord Word goto unsupportedTargetCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.wrongArgument bind wrongArgumentWord Word goto wrongArgumentCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.argumentCount bind argumentCountWord Word goto argumentCountCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unknownLabel bind unknownLabelWord Word goto unknownLabelCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unknownCall bind unknownCallWord Word goto unknownCallCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unsupportedStep bind unsupportedStepWord Word goto unsupportedStepCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.notMutable bind notMutableWord Word goto notMutableCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.splitBlock bind splitBlockWord Word goto splitBlockCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unsupportedLoop bind unsupportedLoopWord Word goto unsupportedLoopCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.notFailing bind notFailingWord Word goto notFailingCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.lostName bind lostNameWord Word goto lostNameCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.typeOrder bind typeOrderWord Word goto typeOrderCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unknownVariant bind unknownVariantWord Word goto unknownVariantCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unknownOwner bind unknownOwnerWord Word goto unknownOwnerCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.invalidCharacter bind invalidCharacterWord Word goto invalidCharacterCase
rejectionMessage at begin case Rejection.unterminatedText bind unterminatedTextWord Word goto unterminatedTextCase
