diagnostic is operation
diagnostic purpose "Write a rejection as `line:column: message (word)`, the shape of a compiler diagnostic"
diagnostic invariant locatesAndExplains "Gives the line and column of the rejected word, the reason's message, and the word's text"
diagnostic typeParameter none
diagnostic input source String borrowed
diagnostic input rejection Rejection copied
diagnostic input region Region borrowed
diagnostic output String
diagnostic outputOwnedBy region
diagnostic raises none
diagnostic effect none
diagnostic uses none
diagnostic memoryHeap true
diagnostic async false
diagnostic maxRecursion none
diagnostic label begin loopKind none
diagnostic label begin within none
diagnostic label done loopKind none
diagnostic label done within none
diagnostic label plain loopKind none
diagnostic label plain within none
diagnostic let colon Byte 58 immutable
diagnostic let separator String ": " immutable
diagnostic let open String " (" immutable
diagnostic let close Byte 41 immutable
