diagnostic at begin do readStart
diagnostic at begin do readLine
diagnostic at begin do readColumn
diagnostic at begin do readMessage
diagnostic at begin do newText
diagnostic at begin do putLine
diagnostic at begin do putColon
diagnostic at begin do putColumn
diagnostic at begin do putSeparator
diagnostic at begin do putMessage
diagnostic at begin do putOpen
diagnostic at begin do putText
diagnostic at begin do putClose
diagnostic at begin do finish
diagnostic at begin branch ifError finish goto plain else goto done
diagnostic at done return ok described
diagnostic at plain return ok message

