# ---------------------------------------------------------------- listing rows

listRows is operation
listRows purpose "List rows as text, one line per row and each word as line:column, its text, and a bar"
listRows invariant oneLinePerRow "Writes one line per row, each word as its line, a colon, its column, a space, its source text, and a bar"
listRows typeParameter none
listRows input source String borrowed
listRows input words Words borrowed
listRows input rows Rows borrowed
listRows input region Region borrowed
listRows output String
