listRows at putOne goto eachWord
listRows at closeLine do putLineEnd
listRows at closeLine goto eachRow
listRows at finish do finishText
listRows at finish branch ifError finishText goto undecodable else goto done
listRows at done return ok listing
listRows at undecodable return error finishError

